  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Critical Raw Materials opportunity scoping study South Africa-NL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project explores and aligns opportunities areas for Dutch expertise with South Africa experts in the field of Critical Raw Materials (CRM), for example expertise in mining or energy-water-service related to mining activities, permits, soil and water pollution related to mining and processing, land repurposing, waste management and mineral processing. Furthermore, the project presents opportunities to Dutch stakeholders and identify interested Dutch partners in the CRM sector in South Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
